exports[`Session Plan Share — html2canvas photographs the capture tree > on Combined Preseason, Share hands html2canvas a stacked capture — not the live BlockRow ol 1`] = `"<div data-testid="session-plan-capture" class="force-light font-sans" style="display: block; width: 360px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(16, 17, 22); font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; padding: 18px 16px 20px; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: block; margin: 0px 0px 2px; padding: 0px 0px 14px; border-bottom: 3px solid rgb(200, 16, 46);"><p data-testid="session-plan-share-squad" class="uppercase tracking-[.8px] text-ink-faint" style="display: block; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.8px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(99, 105, 116);">U16 Mixed</p><p data-testid="session-plan-share-title" class="font-extrabold text-ink" style="display: block; margin: 6px 0px 0px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.25; color: rgb(16, 17, 22);">U14/U16/U18 Combined Preseason</p><p data-testid="session-plan-share-when" class="text-ink-muted" style="display: block; margin: 6px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(86, 92, 103);">WHEN</p><p data-testid="session-plan-share-pitch" class="text-ink-muted" style="display: block; margin: 6px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(86, 92, 103);">D1</p></div><div data-testid="session-plan-share-block" style="display: block; margin: 0px; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229);"><p data-testid="session-plan-share-title-line" class="font-extrabold text-ink" style="display: block; margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(16, 17, 22);">5 min · Activate (player-led)</p><div style="display: block; margin: 8px 0px 0px;"><span data-testid="session-plan-share-category" style="display: inline-block; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229); background: rgb(247, 247, 247); color: rgb(86, 92, 103); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2;">Warm-up</span></div><p class="text-ink-muted" style="display: block; margin: 10px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(86, 92, 103); white-space: pre-wrap;">Squad run it</p></div><div data-testid="session-plan-share-block" style="display: block; margin: 0px; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229);"><p data-testid="session-plan-share-title-line" class="font-extrabold text-ink" style="display: block; margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(16, 17, 22);">10 min · Piggyback fitness</p><div style="display: block; margin: 8px 0px 0px;"><span data-testid="session-plan-share-category" style="display: inline-block; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229); background: rgb(247, 247, 247); color: rgb(86, 92, 103); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2;">Conditioning</span></div><p class="text-ink-muted" style="display: block; margin: 10px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(86, 92, 103); white-space: pre-wrap;">Pairs, one carries. Twenty metres out, twenty back. Swap. Then a sprint to the far cone and walk the recovery. Keep the line honest — if the carrier dumps early, restart that pair.</p></div><div data-testid="session-plan-share-block" style="display: block; margin: 0px; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229);"><p data-testid="session-plan-share-title-line" class="font-extrabold text-ink" style="display: block; margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(16, 17, 22);">5 min · Water and stretch</p><div style="display: block; margin: 8px 0px 0px;"><span data-testid="session-plan-share-category" style="display: inline-block; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229); background: rgb(247, 247, 247); color: rgb(86, 92, 103); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2;">Cool-down</span></div></div><div data-testid="session-plan-share-block" style="display: block; margin: 0px; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229);"><p data-testid="session-plan-share-title-line" class="font-extrabold text-ink" style="display: block; margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(16, 17, 22);">10 min · 3 v 2 touch</p><div style="display: block; margin: 8px 0px 0px;"><span data-testid="session-plan-share-category" style="display: inline-block; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229); background: rgb(247, 247, 247); color: rgb(86, 92, 103); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2;">Game</span></div><p class="text-ink-muted" style="display: block; margin: 10px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(86, 92, 103); white-space: pre-wrap;">Attack two, defence two. Four touches then off. Reset from the near cone. Last two lines of this note are the ones a short next header used to sit on top of.</p></div><div data-testid="session-plan-share-block" style="display: block; margin: 0px; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229);"><p data-testid="session-plan-share-title-line" class="font-extrabold text-ink" style="display: block; margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(16, 17, 22);">15 min · Touch +1</p><div style="display: block; margin: 8px 0px 0px;"><span data-testid="session-plan-share-category" style="display: inline-block; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229); background: rgb(247, 247, 247); color: rgb(86, 92, 103); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2;">Game</span></div><p class="text-ink-muted" style="display: block; margin: 10px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(86, 92, 103); white-space: pre-wrap;">Same grid, plus one defender arriving late. Catch them before the extra body lands. The header after this used to cover the last two lines.</p></div><div data-testid="session-plan-share-block" style="display: block; margin: 0px; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229);"><p data-testid="session-plan-share-title-line" class="font-extrabold text-ink" style="display: block; margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(16, 17, 22);">15 min · Cool down</p><div style="display: block; margin: 8px 0px 0px;"><span data-testid="session-plan-share-category" style="display: inline-block; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229); background: rgb(247, 247, 247); color: rgb(86, 92, 103); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2;">Cool-down</span></div></div><div data-testid="session-plan-share-block" style="display: block; margin: 0px; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229);"><p data-testid="session-plan-share-title-line" class="font-extrabold text-ink" style="display: block; margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(16, 17, 22);">5 min · Stretch cool-down</p><div style="display: block; margin: 8px 0px 0px;"><span data-testid="session-plan-share-category" style="display: inline-block; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(229, 229, 229); background: rgb(247, 247, 247); color: rgb(86, 92, 103); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2;">Cool-down</span></div><p class="text-ink-muted" style="display: block; margin: 10px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(86, 92, 103); white-space: pre-wrap;">Hamstrings and hips. No bouncing.</p></div><p data-testid="session-plan-share-total" class="font-bold text-ink-muted" style="display: block; margin: 14px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(86, 92, 103);">Total 65 min</p><p class="text-ink-muted" style="display: block; margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(86, 92, 103);">U14/U16/U18 Combined Preseason. Water bottles at the far cone.</p></div>"`;
